# Copy to .env.local, which is gitignored. Placeholders only in this file -- this repository is
# public and a committed credential is public permanently (CLAUDE.md).
#
# Everything named NEXT_PUBLIC_* is compiled into the browser bundle and is readable by anyone who
# loads the page. No secret may ever be given that prefix. The ORS key in particular stays on the
# API, which is why geocoding is proxied rather than called from the browser (docs/design.md 4.4).

# Where the API lives. The dev API runs on :8000 via `make api`; in production this is the real
# origin behind Caddy. The API must list this app's origin in CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
